  "raw_text": "{\n  \"options\": [\n    \"It is my perspective that institutions of higher education ought to consider a student's academic record, written assignments, and extracurricular involvement rather than solely relying on a single standardized test score.\",\n    \"I propose that colleges should evaluate a student's academic performance, their written essays, and their involvement in various activities, rather than placing exclusive emphasis on their standardized test results.\",\n    \"Colleges ought to take into account a student's grades, essays, and extracurricular activities, rather than focusing exclusively on the outcomes of standardized tests.\",\n    \"In my view, higher education institutions should prioritize a student's grades, written essays, and extracurricular activities over the results of standardized tests.\",\n    \"I argue that colleges should adopt a more holistic approach by assessing a student's grades, essays, and activities, instead of concentrating primarily on standardized test scores.\"\n  ]\n}",
